Dialogue: 1,0:21:20.35,0:21:23.15,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,{\bord1.5\fad(150,0)}与追兵牵起手 Pa Pa Pa (Pa)
Dialogue: 1,0:21:23.15,0:21:25.98,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,{\bord1.5}杀手与忍者在 Dance Dance Dance (Da)
Dialogue: 1,0:21:25.98,0:21:28.86,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,{\bord1.5}好不容易闪烁光芒 想要活下去啊
Dialogue: 1,0:21:28.86,0:21:31.66,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,{\bord1.5}你果然很可爱啊 (Foo!)
